<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><meta name="color-scheme" content="light"><title>We received your form</title></head>
<body style="margin:0;padding:0;background:#f1f4f6;color:#26333a;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">
  <div style="display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;opacity:0;color:transparent;">Your {{formType}} form has been received. Thank you for reaching out.</div>
  <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" style="background:#f1f4f6;"><tr><td align="center" style="padding:38px 14px;">
    <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" style="max-width:560px;background:#fff;">
      <tr><td style="padding:30px 34px 22px;border-top:5px solid #42798a;">
        <p style="margin:0 0 10px;color:#42798a;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:1.2px;text-transform:uppercase;">Message received</p>
        <h1 style="margin:0;color:#26333a;font:normal 29px/1.25 Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;">Thank you, {{fullName}}.</h1>
      </td></tr>
      <tr><td style="padding:0 34px 32px;">
        <p style="margin:0 0 20px;color:#4b5a60;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;">We have received your submission and appreciate you taking the time to connect with WaterGate Church.</p>
        <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" style="background:#eef4f5;border-left:4px solid #42798a;"><tr><td style="padding:16px 18px;color:#42545a;font-size:13px;line-height:1.6;">Submission type<br><strong style="display:block;margin-top:4px;color:#26333a;font-size:16px;">{{formType}}</strong></td></tr></table>
        <p style="margin:22px 0 0;color:#4b5a60;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;">Our team will review your message and follow up when a response is needed. Please reply to this email if you need to add anything.</p>
      </td></tr>
      <tr><td style="padding:18px 34px;background:#26333a;color:#fff;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;">Watergate Church Global &middot; &copy; {{year}}<br>This is an automatic confirmation of your submission.</td></tr>
    </table>
  </td></tr></table>
</body>
</html>
